00:00.000 --> 00:05.500
Today. One cover for the day, made from your family's own photos and writing. This one is Milo & Rooney, together, gathered from moments kept from 2022 to 2024.

00:05.500 --> 00:10.000
Tap the cover and it opens into the story behind it — the moments Rooney pulled together, in order.

00:10.000 --> 00:11.500
Back to Today.

00:11.500 --> 00:15.000
Explore. Your family's moments as a feed you can scroll. At the top, choose whose story you are seeing — Everyone, Rooney's story, Milo's story — or ask Rooney for a thread, a moment, anything.

00:15.000 --> 00:21.000
Scroll through the feed. Some moments hold more than one photo — swipe to see them all. Tap to read a caption in full.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.500
Adding is one tap. The Add sheet offers Photo or video, and the form is ready to take the moment as it happened.

00:25.500 --> 00:29.500
Threads. The recurring stories that make up your family's journey — the same people, places and loves, coming back across the years.

00:29.500 --> 00:34.000
Open a thread and the moments line up across the years, so you can watch the pattern grow.

00:34.000 --> 00:38.500
The menu keeps the rest close: Today, Questions, Family & people, Plan & room, Year Film, and Help & settings.

00:38.500 --> 00:39.880
Roon. Your family's story, told from the moments you already kept.
